 r←GenerateNamesFromPath paths;names;string;pattern
 ⍝ Generate unique APL names from vector of paths, removing path patterns and invalid symbols

 string←'''(?:[^\r\n'']|'''')*'''
 pattern←'(\((?:',string,'|[^()'']|(?1))*\))'  ⍝ group: (nested)parens
 names←'^_?.'⎕R'\u0'⊢'^/'pattern'((/{\w+})+)' '[^A-Za-zÀ-ÖØ-Ýß-öø-üþ∆⍙Ⓐ-Ⓩ0-9]'⎕R'' 'Key' 'Key' '_'⊢⊆paths
 names←{⊆⊢/⍵⌷⍨⊂⍋⍵}⊃⍪/{1=≢⍵:⊂⍵,⍪⍺ ⋄ ⊂⍵,⍪⍺,¨'_',∘⍕¨⍳≢⍵}⌸names ⍝ add nr suffix for duplicates
 r←names
 ⍝
